      english: Command, I'm back on my feet.
      vietnamese: "B\u1ED9 ch\u1EC9 huy, t\xF4i \u0111\u1EE9ng d\u1EADy \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
        r\u1ED3i."
    - role: 2
      english: Copy. Can you keep up with the team?
      vietnamese: "\u0110\xE3 nh\u1EADn. C\xF3 theo k\u1ECBp \u0111\u1ED9i kh\xF4ng?"
    - role: 0
      english: Yeah. Rejoining the team now.
      vietnamese: "\u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c. T\xF4i nh\u1EADp \u0111\u1ED9i ngay \u0111\xE2y."
    soloCues:
    - role: 0
      english: Command, I'm back on my feet.
      vietnamese: "B\u1ED9 ch\u1EC9 huy, t\xF4i \u0111\u1EE9ng d\u1EADy \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
        r\u1ED3i."
    - role: 2
      english: Copy. Can you move on your own?
      vietnamese: "\u0110\xE3 nh\u1EADn. T\u1EF1 \u0111i ti\u1EBFp \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
        ch\u01B0a?"
    - role: 0
      english: Yeah. I can keep moving.
      vietnamese: "\u0110\u01B0\u1EE3c. T\xF4i \u0111i ti\u1EBFp \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c."
  objectives:
  - id: 1
    title: ISOLATE PRODUCTION
    instructions: Isolate production at the isolation panel. Follow Utilities Procedure
      and keep the cold-store circuit connected.
    result: Backup control unlocks.
    hint: Read Utilities Procedure for the production isolation step.
    hint2: Reopen Utilities Procedure in Files and find the production / backup sequence.
    hint3: Use Utilities Procedure to identify the isolation control before engaging
      backup.
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 1
  - id: 2
    title: BACKUP COLD STORE
    instructions: Engage the cold-store backup at the backup panel after Isolate.
      This enables Generator.
    result: Generator control unlocks.
    hint: Read the backup-feed step in Utilities Procedure.
    hint2: Reopen Utilities Procedure in Files and compare the backup-feed sequence.
    hint3: Use Utilities Procedure to distinguish the cold-store backup from production.
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 1
  - id: 3
    title: START GENERATOR
    instructions: Start the cold-store generator after Backup. Confirm the physical
      control to restore power.
    result: Power branch is recorded.
    hint: Read the generator step in Utilities Procedure.
    hint2: Reopen Utilities Procedure in Files and check the physical-control warning.
    hint3: Use Utilities Procedure to check the generator control rather than relying
      on its lamp.
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 1
  - id: 4
    title: READ DELIVERY MANIFEST
    instructions: Read the Delivery Manifest to record it in team Files and unlock
      Verify Shipping Release.
    result: Manifest appears in Files.
    hint: Read the Delivery Manifest at its marked interaction body.
    hint2: Open Files in team inventory to reread the Delivery Manifest once recorded.
    hint3: Use the Delivery Manifest as the source for the shipping release comparison.
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 2
  - id: 5
    title: VERIFY SHIPPING RELEASE
    instructions: Compare the shipping release with the recorded Delivery Manifest.
      Select both groups to verify Logistics.
    result: Logistics branch is recorded.
    hint: Read the recorded Delivery Manifest before comparing the two groups.
    hint2: Reopen the Delivery Manifest in Files; compare shipment / seal and destination
      / receiving time separately.
    hint3: Use the Delivery Manifest as the source for each group; no choice is selected
      for you.
    choices:
    - AL-03 / K9
    - AL-04 / K6
    - AL-07 / K2
    secondaryChoices:
    - NORTH DEPOT / 06:10
    - NORTHBRIDGE / 02:40
    - NORTHBRIDGE / 04:20
    file: 2
  - id: 6
    title: SECURE T9-17 CASE
    instructions: Recover the sealed evidence case and its records after Power, Logistics
      and the Tank are confirmed.
    result: Case joins team inventory.
    hint: Restore Power, verify Logistics and bring down the Tank before collecting
      the case.
    hint2: Review the recorded Delivery Manifest and Utilities Procedure for incomplete
      branch steps.
    hint3: Read the B2 Transfer Addendum after collection to continue the evidence
      trail.
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 3
  - id: 7
    title: OPEN SERVICE ROUTE
    instructions: Activate the service-route control cabinet after recovering the
      case. Prepare for the interlock cycle.
    result: Service-route countdown starts.
    hint: Review the case record before using the service-route control cabinet.
    hint2: Reopen the B2 Transfer Addendum in Files to review the recorded route.
    hint3: Read the preparation and boarding status after activating the control
      cabinet.
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 0
  - id: 8
    title: READ SECURITY DESK LOG
    instructions: Record the technical intake hidden behind the public admissions
      log.
    result: Desk log appears in Files.
    hint: Read the Security Desk Log; it points to the upper records room and the
      service fuse.
    hint2: 
    hint3: 
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 4
  - id: 9
    title: RECOVER SERVICE FUSE
    instructions: Recover the spare fuse from ground-floor maintenance storage.
    result: Fuse joins team inventory.
    hint: The fuse is shared by the squad and can be installed by any living operator.
    hint2: 
    hint3: 
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 0
  - id: 10
    title: INSTALL SERVICE FUSE
    instructions: Install the recovered fuse at the lower service panel.
    result: Service power can be restored.
    hint: Read the desk log and recover the fuse; neither is consumed by a wrong
      interaction.
    hint2: 
    hint3: 
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 0
  - id: 11
    title: RESTORE SERVICE POWER
    instructions: Bring the lower service circuit online after fitting the replacement
      fuse.
    result: Upper records become accessible.
    hint: The upper records room needs this circuit.
    hint2: 
    hint3: 
    choices: []
    secondaryChoices: []
    file: 0
  - id: 12
    title: IDENTIFY PATIENT
    instructions: Select the record matching the desk log's group and receiving time.
    result: Intake comparison is recorded.
    hint: Compare the intake sheet against the group and receiving time recorded
      in the Security Desk Log.
    hint2: 
