  - id: 13
    title: VERIFY MORTUARY TRANSFER
    instructions: Select the discrepancy that requires independent review. Retain
      the B2 card with the report.
    result: Lift card joins team inventory.
    hint: Read the Mortuary Transfer Discrepancy and compare its fields with the
      recorded Intake Record.
    hint2: 
